Hi,

I realised that jnettop does not build on 32 bit architectures (except
for i386 which is strange and might be just build but not work).  There
is a time_t 64 issue suspected.  To avoid further build attempts I've
just uploaded

 jnettop (0.13.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Build-Depends: architecture-is-64-bit

Please remove the binary packages from the 32 bit architectures to
enable testing migration.

Kind regards and thank you for your work as ftpmaster
    Andreas.



